                { "book": "rhythm-of-war", "chapter": "44" }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kaladin often thought of Nalma as one of the people he had failed to protect, especially when his friends were in danger or when he was being hunted himself.",
